Begin after [completing the eight-book core](../research/Core-completion.lingua#r_562HHAD8ARXMYG8DC0GP1QKYAT). These continuations develop different questions rather than forming one compulsory stack. An introductory explanation can be valuable here as a comparison; its position does not establish that it is more advanced than a canonical collection.

