Read primary texts, commentary, and historical explanations in distinguishable roles. A later account may challenge an earlier interpretation. Develop the languages, historical setting, and scholarly debate actually needed by the selected question. Return through [textual study](../research/Textual-study.lingua#r_5ATB59ZTXZHDEKYE94B3ZR5H74) and the [research investigation](../research/Research-study.lingua#r_5KS9ZFFK5HYPAMBYJQ9ACHF3NJ) for a demanding finish.

